age"><span class="kimo-banner__title">Rebase in progress</span><span class="kimo-banner__body">Autosave is paused until git finishes. Your edits are kept in memory.</span></div><div class="kimo-banner__actions"><button data-action="discard" type="button" class="kimo-button kimo-button--ghost kimo-banner__action kimo-banner__action--ghost"><span class="kimo-button__label">Discard</span></button><button data-action="keep" type="button" class="kimo-button kimo-button--primary kimo-banner__action"><span class="kimo-button__label">Keep my edits</span></button></div><button type="button" class="kimo-icon-button kimo-icon-button--sm kimo-icon-button--quiet kimo-banner__dismiss" aria-label="Dismiss"><span class="kimo-icon-button__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></span></button></div><div role="alert" data-pen="Gq3Fs" data-tone="danger" class="kimo-banner kimo-banner--danger"><span class="kimo-banner__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-x lucide-x-circle" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m15 9-6 6"></path><path d="m9 9 6 6"></path></svg></span><div class="kimo-banner__message"><span class="kimo-banner__title">Couldn&#x27;t save</span><span class="kimo-banner__body">The disk is full (ENOSPC). Edits are safe in a recovery file.</span></div><div class="kimo-banner__actions"><button data-action="save-as" type="button" class="kimo-button kimo-button--ghost kimo-banner__action kimo-banner__action--ghost"><span class="kimo-button__label">Save as…</span></button><button data-actio